* a simple implementation for named bows (followup to other posts):

in addition to normal bows (crossbows, etc.) there should be rare but
normally discoverable named bows that increase the damage (+5) done by
their corresponding arrows. while wielded, a named bow may also endow
magic to the wielder. bows may not be manually named. an example:
an uncursed +0 crossbow named Apollo:
  uses crossbow bolts,
  increases (+5) the damage done by the bolt while wielded,
  adds fire attack to the bolt while wielded,
  adds (+2) stength while wielded,
  adds (+2) charisma while wielded,
  adds fire resistance while wielded.
other possibilities include:
a bow named William Tell (adds +5 to hit for arrows, increase dexterity ...)
a long bow named Hercules (adds +10 strength to the wielder, ...)
